    titleEN: "Voter Registration in Nepal",
    titleNE: "मतदाता नामावली दर्ता",
    summaryEN: "Only Nepali citizens whose names are on the electoral roll can vote, and voting age is 18. Registration is run by the Election Commission, with proof of citizenship and age, plus a photograph and fingerprints collected during enrolment.",
